<title>USA: AGCO names Jean-Paul Richard president, CEO.</title>
<headline>AGCO names Jean-Paul Richard president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>AGCO Corp, which makes and distributes agricultural equipment, said on Monday it named Jean-Paul Richard president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Richard was previously president and CEO of Insituform Technologies Inc.  </p>
<p>Robert Ratliff, chairman of the board, had also held the title of chief executive officer, the company said.</p>
<p>There had been no president position, but there were three group presidents who reported to Ratliff, AGCO said. These group presidents would now report to Richard, it said.</p>
</text>
